[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5838.629, "timestamp": "01:37:18", "text": "不太好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5840.47, "timestamp": "01:37:20", "text": "等待。他們現在要走了。他們都要去。阿拉斯加。什麼？什麼？他的戰術是什麼？我不明白。你存錢買雞蛋。但我還是不明白"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5844.189, "timestamp": "01:37:24", "text": "。這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5848.229, "timestamp": "01:37:28", "text": "是新情況。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5851.35, "timestamp": "01:37:31", "text": "我之前也這麼想過。我學到了很多。影子在移動。  部署無人機。  那裡有人。  正在掃描前方區域。  正在通過。我走了。  還剩一個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5853.91, "timestamp": "01:37:33", "text": "敵人。  就在這裡。  我走了。  他媽的。我好痛。  好的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5861.519, "timestamp": "01:37:41", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "are u sure? he could be from sydney or ID"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5872.95, "timestamp": "01:37:52", "text": "。  我玩的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5874.84, "timestamp": "01:37:54", "text": "Apex。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5876.229, "timestamp": "01:37:56", "text": "[音樂]咖哩之地"}]